  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Global <a href=\"/tag/private+equity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">private equity</a> firm <a href=\"/tag/permira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Permira</a> is set to acquire a 25.71% stake in <a href=\"/tag/kids+clinic+india+limited\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kids Clinic India Limited</a> (KCIL), the parent company of <a href=\"/tag/cloudnine+hospitals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cloudnine Hospitals</a>, in a transaction that values India’s largest <a href=\"/tag/maternity+and+paediatric+hospital+chain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">maternity and paediatric hospital chain</a> at around Rs 11,000 crore, people familiar with the matter said.According to a summary of the proposed combination, the <a href=\"/tag/acquisition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">acquisition</a> will be through NuageLux BidCo a private limited company newly incorporated under the laws of Luxembourg.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The summary noted a potential indirect and minuscule vertical relationship has been identified between a controlled entity of Permira which is engaged in the manufacture and sale of pharmaceutical products in India (Upstream Market), and the Target (including its relevant entities) which are engaged in the provision of <a href=\"/tag/healthcare+services+in+india\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">healthcare services in India</a> (Downstream Market).</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The London-headquartered buyout firm has emerged ahead of rival <a href=\"/tag/tpg+capital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TPG Capital</a> to acquire the roughly 25% stake held by existing investor True North Capital.The transaction is subject to regulatory approvals, with Permira having already sought the <a href=\"/tag/competition+commission+of+india\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Competition Commission of India</a>’s nod for the deal. The potential <a href=\"/tag/investment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">investment</a> comes after both Permira and TPG Capital emerged as frontrunners for a significant minority stake in Cloudnine, as first reported by ET on August 1.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>KCIL has one wholly-owned subsidiary, Acquity Labs Private Limited. It is also in the process of acquiring Apollo Specialty Hospitals Private Limited and Apollo Fertility Centre Private Limited from Apollo Health and Lifestyle Limited, which is currently pending approval before the Competition Commission of India (CCI), the summary noted.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Reghu Balakrishnan,Twesh Mishra</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Reghu Balakrishnan</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                             &amp; \n                                                                                                                                            <a>Twesh Mishra</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675387/ET-Bureau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ET Bureau</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Sep 2, 2026 at 07:26 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Sep 2, 2026 at 07:26 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n     